Hi,

Our next Open Printing call will be *this* Wednesday on 10 October.

Minutes from our last OP call are archived at:

  ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/openprinting/minutes/OP-Minutes-20120905.htm

Agenda:

(1) Printing News (Till K, others)

(2) Status of Common Mobile Print Client (Glen P)

(3) OP Future Directions (all)
- Cloud Print (multi-domain issues, document content privacy)
- Multifunction Services (scan, fax, etc.)
- Lightweight Transform Service
- Lightweight Print Service (for mobile and other small devices)
- LSB 5.0

(4) PWG Highlights for Open Printing (Ira M, Glen P)
- PWG Meeting as Virtual F2F on 1-2 October 2012
-- IPP Everywhere - completion in Q1 2013
-- IPP Multifunction - in progress throughout 2013
-- Cloud Print Model - Prototype draft in Q2 2013
-- Cloud WG to SM WG - Mapping of PWG Print Job Ticket
-- Transform Service - Prototype draft in Q2 2013
-- CWMP BOF - SOHO Print Model to be proposed to BBF in Q1 2013

Dial-in information:

October 2012 - US/Europe - OP Monthly Meeting

    - Note - PWG Meeting - 1-2 October 2012
    - Note - TCG Meeting in Vancouver, BC - 16-18 October 2012

    - Wednesday 10 October 2012, Daytime
      - US
        9am in San Francisco - US PDT (Pacific Daylight Time)
        10am in Colorado - US MDT (Mountain Daylight Time)
        11am in Chicago - US CDT (Central Daylight Time)
        12pm in New York - US EDT (Eastern Daylight Time)
      - Europe
        6pm in Berlin - CEST (Central European Summer Time)

    * Main Number (Till Kamppeter, LF, leader)
      International: +1-218-936-7999
      Access Code:   491659#

Cheers,
- Ira

